# =============================================================
#  .gitignore para proyectos Vivado — IEE2463 SEP
#  Copiar a la raíz del repositorio (junto al .xpr o sobre él).
# =============================================================

# --- Carpetas generadas por Vivado (se regeneran al abrir y compilar) ---
*.cache/
*.hw/
*.ip_user_files/
*.runs/
*.sim/
*.gen/
*.Xil/
.Xil/

# --- Logs y journals ---
*.jou
*.log
*.str
vivado*.backup.jou
vivado*.backup.log
webtalk*.jou
webtalk*.log
usage_statistics_webtalk*

# --- Salidas de implementación ---
*.bit
*.bin
*.ltx
*.mmi
*.rpt

# --- Vitis / SDK ---
.metadata/
*.sdk/
Debug/
Release/
_ide/

# --- Sistema operativo / editores ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# =============================================================
#  QUÉ SÍ SE VERSIONA (no tocar, aquí solo como recordatorio):
#    *.vhd   fuentes y testbenches
#    *.xdc   constraints
#    *.xpr   proyecto de Vivado
#    *.bd    block design
#    *.tcl   script de reconstrucción (File > Project > Write Tcl)
#    ip/     IP cores propios (carpeta con su component.xml)
#    docs/   diagrama, CONTEXT.md, REFERENCIAS.md
#
#  Archivos > 100 MB: GitHub los rechaza. Usar Git LFS.
# =============================================================

# --- Productos generados del block design (se regeneran con Generate Output Products) ---
*.dcp
*_stub.v
*_stub.vhdl
*_sim_netlist.v
*_sim_netlist.vhdl
*.hwdef
*.hwh
*.protoinst
**/bd/*/ipshared/
**/bd/*/hw_handoff/
**/bd/*/ip/*/sim/
**/bd/*/ip/*/synth/
